class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the best strategy 🧠 by discovering skills in a familiar, survivor-like fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192050/extras/9a66ed5d6c94ac63c26538a8fa611269.poster.avif?t=1779725978\" width=620 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192050/extras/9a66ed5d6c94ac63c26538a8fa611269.webm?t=1779725978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192050/extras/9a66ed5d6c94ac63c26538a8fa611269.mp4?t=1779725978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the best loot 🏆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game world is rich with enigmatic artifacts: ancient wands, mystic stones 💎, leaf cloaks 🍃, elk skulls 🦌💀, and more ✨.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192050/extras/d5f27476d0ec4c29c6fd1a22392e490f.poster.avif?t=1779725978\" width=620 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192050/extras/d5f27476d0ec4c29c6fd1a22392e490f.webm?t=1779725978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192050/extras/d5f27476d0ec4c29c6fd1a22392e490f.mp4?t=1779725978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your tree spirits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allow the tree spirits 🌳 to grant you their powers in The Coven of the Forest ✨. Manage and strategize so that their abilities provide you with the biggest bang 💥.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akama